  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "The Warm-Massage Breast Pump | Pumping That Feels Like Care | Warmth Meets Comfort | World's First Warm Pump | Feel the Difference, Mom | 360° wraparound warmth + rhythmic massage. Pumping has never felt this good. | App-controlled, 10 sessions per charge. Designed for real mom life. | SoftPulse massage mimics baby's natural rhythm. Relax & let down faster. | No more cold, mechanical suction. Just warmth, comfort, and care. | Brand new from Momcozy. Discover why moms are calling it a game-changer.",
